From h0cheung/tb322fc-linux-kernel 6f97250ead155fc3b980856323e99a4623dae73d
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/dsi: Elden bonded command DMA closure

Selective adaptation of the SM8750 dual-DSI bonded command path from
the pin tree.  Only the Elden (lenovo,elden) bonded-sync master-DSI0
path is enabled; there are no SM8750-wide or non-Elden behavioural
changes.  ArmadaOS fixes preserved in place: 0016 (host prepare video
control) and 0505 (GEM locking).  No splash, reserved-memory, SMMU or
RCU changes.

Files:
  drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi.h
  drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_host.c
  drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_manager.c
  drivers/gpu/drm/msm/registers/display/dsi.xml
  drivers/gpu/drm/msm/msm_gem.c
  drivers/gpu/drm/msm/msm_gem.h

sourceprovenance: pin@6f97250ead155fc3b980856323e99a4623dae73d

